   "summary": "Can we just pretend to have fun? I fully realize college sports have changed, and we\u2019re never going back to the way things used to be. But have we really reached the point where we can\u2019t even enjoy a walk-off field goal victory, one that featured one of the greatest individual performances in Mountaineer Field [&#8230;]",
